that this is a legacy customer essentially,

00:43:09.543 --> 00:43:11.783
and that the price would be the exact same

00:43:11.783 --> 00:43:16.264
through 2028 and into that 2029 renewal.

00:43:16.304 --> 00:43:18.744
So there will not be additional costs during this period

00:43:18.744 --> 00:43:22.543
if you continue to renew as expected on ShinyApps.io

00:43:22.543 --> 00:43:25.744
for this next year or so period as we get to that state.

00:43:28.023 --> 00:43:30.144
Excellent, and short one,

